{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>וְרָדוּ</b> — twice in the Masorah: וְרָדוּ בְכֶם שֹׂנְאֵיכֶם, and the other: וְרָדוּ בַנֹּגְשִׂים. If you merit — וְרָדוּ בַנֹּגְשִׂים (they shall rule over the taskmasters); now that you do not merit — וְרָדוּ בְכֶם שֹׂנְאֵיכֶם (they shall rule over you, your enemies)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:47.009433647Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}